== clang -print-target-triple ==
x86_64-linux-gnu       -> x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu
x86_64-unknown-myos    -> x86_64-unknown-myos
== predefined macros: how many, and those that name an operating system ==
x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu: 389 macros; OS-related: __ELF__ __gnu_linux__ __linux __linux__ __unix __unix__ 
x86_64-unknown-myos: 375 macros; OS-related: __ELF__ 
